  "description": "<strong>Race Across the World: The Experience West End</strong><br>\n⭐ London, it's time to race through the West End! Experience the official adventure based on the award-winning TV show in London's iconic theatre district. Navigate the vibrant streets of the West End with no maps, no public transport, just your team and London's legendary landmarks. Strategy meets adventure in this ultimate city challenge!<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\n📺 Step into the official experience based on the hit TV show<br>\n🏛️ Discover London's West End across Soho, Covent Garden, and Mayfair through 3 checkpoints<br>\n☕ Take optional breaks at each checkpoint with exclusive race discounts at partner venues<br>\n🧩 Crack escape room-style puzzles, decipher clues and unlock city surprises<br>\n💰 Master your virtual budget to unlock shortcuts and secret routes<br>\n🏃 Race head-to-head or team up against the clock to climb the live leaderboard and claim glory<br>\n📖 Find and sign the guestbook to cement your legacy<br>\n🎁 The perfect adventure for friends, couples, families, and colleagues. Click here for more information<br>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--td {border: 1px solid #cccccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}-->\n</style>\n🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card for Race Across the World: The Experience West End <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/342067\">here</a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\n📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br>\n⏳ Duration: 2-3 hours, varies depending on how competitive you are! (without breaks)<br>\n📍 Start location: near Green Park Tube Station, London<br>\n🚇 Nearest underground: Green Park<br>\n🚂 Nearest rail: Charing Cross, Piccadilly, Leicester Square<br>\n🚌 Bus: multiple routes serve the West End<br>\n🏁 Finish location: Covent Garden area<br>\n🚶 Distance: approximately 3-5 km/2-3.0 miles<br>\n👤 Age requirement: all ages are welcome! Each team must contain at least one adult (16+). Children under 10 enter free with paying adults<br>\n♿ Accessibility: fully wheelchair accessible (select when setting up your team).<br>\n🐶 Dog-friendly: routes available for teams with furry companions<br>\n👥 Team size: 2-8 players per team. Book together, play together! Large groups can split into multiple teams and compete head-to-head<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\nYou've watched it on TV, now live it for real! Race Across the World: The Experience transforms London's West End into your adventure playground. In this 2-3 hour experience, race through Soho, Covent Garden and Mayfair solving puzzles, managing your virtual budget, and making every decision count. With checkpoints, physical challenges, and surprises around every corner, teamwork and strategy are key. Finish fast, spend smart - and climb the live leaderboard to become London's ultimate racing champions! Ready to race? Book your West End adventure today!<br>\nWe also offer a different route in London, check it out <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/334826\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a>!<br>\n&nbsp;",
